<title>BELGIUM: Belgium sells further 7.385 bln bfr of OLOs.</title>
<headline>Belgium sells further 7.385 bln bfr of OLOs.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the following details of linear bond (OLO) sales volume at its non-competitive OLO auction - (in billions of Belgian francs)</p>
<p>    Bond line		03/2001   03/2007    Grand total</p>
<p>    Competitive auction  7.600     8.100     15.700</p>
<p>    Non-compet.auction   2.915     4.470	7.385</p>
<p>    Total		   10.515    12.570     23.085</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
